<title>GERMANY: MG says 95/96 net profit up 86.4 pct.</title>
<headline>MG says 95/96 net profit up 86.4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fiscal year to September 30</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group net profit			   220     vs 118</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German diversified engineering and trading group is Metallgesellschaft AG. The company also said that in 1995/1996 it achieved a return on capital employed of nine percent versus eight percent in the previous year. It said the medium-term target is 14 percent. The return on sales in 1995/1996 doubled to two percent.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
